---
export const prerender = false;

// Making a page is the pages list's "New page" dialog now (Admin v2 E11, AV-33): this address
// opens the list with the dialog open. The old form asked for a page's address and title with
// nothing to say which addresses the site already answers, and made a page no route rendered
// (E11 renders them, and its dialog holds the rules). A 302, not a 301: an admin route is never
// cached, and a later screen may take the address back. The list decides who may make a page.
return Astro.redirect('/admin/pages?new=1', 302);
---
